	* Draw an ellipse.
	Note: The current scaled drawing-point is used as the center of the ellipse.
	   grid			The grid
	   color		The color in which to draw
	   rx				The X-Radius
	   ry				The Y-Radius

	See: XgrSetDrawpointScaled()

FUNCTION  XgrDrawEllipseScaled (grid, color, rx#, ry#)
